01:16:27.960 --> 01:16:29.120 line:63%
 - Yaël Braun-Pivet: 
 Je vous remercie. 

01:16:29.160 --> 01:16:39.680 line:63%
 La parole est à monsieur 
 Aurélien Rousseau. 

01:16:39.720 --> 01:16:45.000 line:63%
 - Aurélien Rousseau: 
