01:21:07.960 --> 01:21:13.440 line:63%
 - Yaël Braun-Pivet: 
 Je vous remercie. 

01:21:13.480 --> 01:21:14.640 line:61%
 La parole est à monsieur Fesneau. 

01:21:14.680 --> 01:21:18.960 line:63%
 - Marc Fesneau: 
 J'ai l'impression 

01:21:19.000 --> 01:21:27.720 line:61%
